{"id":"word:hebrew:H490","type":"word","title":"אַלְמָנָה","subtitle":"H490 • Hebrew word","simple":{"meaning":"a widow ; also a desolate place","inThisVerse":"The selected word is tied to אַלְמָנָה (H490) in the Hebrew source text. Part of speech: n-f.","whyItMatters":"This word appears 56 times in the Hebrew Bible, so BibleIQ can compare how Scripture uses it across multiple passages.","summary":"אַלְמָנָה (ʼalmânâh) means a widow ; also a desolate place First listed occurrence: 1Kgs 7 14."},"evidence":{"originalLanguage":{"source":"hebrew","word":"אַלְמָנָה","transliteration":"ʼalmânâh","pronunciation":"al-maw-naw'","strong":"H490","lemmaId":"hebrew:H490","partOfSpeech":"n-f","forms":["אַלְמָנָֽה","אַלְמָנָ֖ה","אַלְמָנָ֣ה","אַלְמָנָ֔ה","וְ/לָ/אַלְמָנָ֖ה"],"morphs":[["HNcfsa",22],["HC/Ncfsa",9],["HC/Rd/Ncfsa",5],["HC/Td/Ncfsa",4],["HNcfpa",4],["HNcfpc/Sp3ms",3],["HC/Ncfpc/Sp3ms",2],["HTd/Ncfsa",1],["HNcfpc/Sp3fs",1],["HR/Ncfpc/Sp3ms",1]]},"definitions":{"short":"a widow ; also a desolate place","usage":"desolate house (palace), widow.","full":"H490. almanah אַלְמָנָה 54 noun feminine widow (Mishna id. , Assyrian almattu Dl in Zim BP 114 ) — ׳א Gen 38:11 +; no construct; plural אַלְמָנוֺת Exod 22:23 +; plural suffix אַלְמְנוֺתָיו Job 27:18 , etc. &#8212; widow 1Kin 17:20 ; אַ ׳אִשָּׁה 2Sam 14:5 (|| אִישִׁי וַיָּ֫מָת ) 1Kin 7:14 ; 11:26 ; 17:9-10 , Gen 38:11 (J; living in father's house) compare Lev 22:13 (H; || גְּרוּשָׁה ); 21:14 (H), where widow forbidden as wife of high priest, like זֹנָה חֲלָלָה, גְּרוּשָׁה, compare Ezek 44:22 (3 t. in verse) ( id. of all priests, except widow of priest); Num 30:10 (P; of widow's vow, || גְּרוּשָׁה ); אַלְמָנוֺת נְשֵׁיכֶם = ye shall be slain Exod 22:23 (|| יְתֹמִים בְּנֵיכֶם ) compare Psa 109:9 ; Jer 15:8 ; 18:21 ; Ezek 22:25 , also Lam 5:3 ; (simile); of those snatched away by pestilence תִבְכֶּינָה לֹא אַלְמְנוֺתָיו Job 27:15 ; by sword, id. , Psa 78:64 ; ᵐ5 We read חַיּוֺת אַלְמָנוֺת 2Sam 20:3 (see אַלְמָנוּת below) of imprisoned concubines; figurative of Jerusalem Lam 1:1 ; Babylon Isa 47:8 ; especially widow as helpless, exposed to oppression & harsh treatment (often || יָתוֺם , & גֵּר ); 1:23 ; 10:2 ; Job 22:9 ; 24:3 ; 31:16 ; Psa 94:6 ; Mal 3:5 ; harshness forbidden, & care for them enjoined Exod 22:21 (E) Deut 14:29 ; 16:11 , 14 ; 24:17 , 19 , 20 , 21 ; 26:12-13 , 27:19 ; Isa 1:17 ; Jer 7:6 ; 22:3 ; Zech 7:10 , compare Job 29:13 ; under especially care of God Deut 10:18 ; Jer 49:11 ; Prov 15:25 ; Psa 68:6 ; 146:9 ; once of severity of judgment in not sparing widow Isa 9:16 . ( ׳אַל 13:22 see below אַרְמוֺן ; Ezek 19:7 see ib. & also below מעון .)","rootNote":"feminine of 488 ;","sources":["MorphHB occurrences","Strong Hebrew Dictionary","Brown-Driver-Briggs"]},"firstMention":"1Kgs 7 14","keyReferences":["1Kgs 7 14","1Kgs 11 26","1Kgs 17 9","1Kgs 17 10","1Kgs 17 20","2Sam 14 5","Deut 10 18","Deut 14 29"],"related":{"people":[],"places":[],"concepts":[],"events":[]},"occurrenceCount":56,"occurrences":[{"reference":"1Kgs 7 14","book":"1Kgs","chapter":7,"verse":14,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"אַלְמָנָ֨ה","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcfsa"},{"reference":"1Kgs 11 26","book":"1Kgs","chapter":11,"verse":26,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"אַלְמָנָ֔ה","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcfsa"},{"reference":"1Kgs 17 9","book":"1Kgs","chapter":17,"verse":9,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"אַלְמָנָ֖ה","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcfsa"},{"reference":"1Kgs 17 10","book":"1Kgs","chapter":17,"verse":10,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"אַלְמָנָ֖ה","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcfsa"},{"reference":"1Kgs 17 20","book":"1Kgs","chapter":17,"verse":20,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"הָ/אַלְמָנָ֞ה","source":"hebrew","morph":"HTd/Ncfsa"},{"reference":"2Sam 14 5","book":"2Sam","chapter":14,"verse":5,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"אַלְמָנָ֥ה","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcfsa"},{"reference":"Deut 10 18","book":"Deut","chapter":10,"verse":18,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"וְ/אַלְמָנָ֑ה","source":"hebrew","morph":"HC/Ncfsa"}